---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About House Designer · buildmy.house"
  description="House Designer is a free, browser-based 3D home design tool — no download, no account. Draw a plan, furnish it, and walk through it in 3D."
>
  <section class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow">About the project</span>
    <h1>Rooms are stories in three dimensions.</h1>
    <p>House Designer is a focused home design tool for people planning their own place — not professional architecture software with a learning curve. Draw an accurate plan, see it as a live 3D model, and get a photoreal render when you want to see it for real — all free and right in your browser, with no download and no account required.</p>
    <figure class="about-shot">
      <img
        src="/screenshots/v2-04-app-3d-view.png"
        alt="Live 3D view of a room design in House Designer"
        width="1600"
        height="1000"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>A real screenshot of the app's 3D view — House Designer is still in active development, so expect the interface to keep changing.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-shot {
    margin-top: 50px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .about-shot img {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: block;
    height: auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .about-shot figcaption {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .75rem;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
</style>
